<title>NETHERLANDS: ANT. VERF 1996 PROFIT 0.68 MLN ANT. GLDRS.</title>
<headline>ANT. VERF 1996 PROFIT 0.68 MLN ANT. GLDRS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of Netherlands Antilles guilders)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.682 vs    0.752</p>
<p>NOTE - Curacao-based paint manufacturer Antilliaanse</p>
<p>Verffabriek NV said it would pay an unchanged dividend of 25</p>
<p>percent. It said that barring unforeseen increases in raw</p>
<p>material costs or unfavourable developments in consumer</p>
<p>purchasing power it expected sales and profits to be stable in</p>
<p>1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
